            "expect:route": "OrdersApi__fd919pyv.xml:607 sets the Http Settings Route to 'card-types', which matches `api.MapGet(\"/card-types\", GetCardTypesAsync)` in src/Ordering.API/Apis/OrdersApi.cs:23.",
            "expect:kept": "`public string? Barcode` is still in CatalogItem.cs:53, `HasMaxLength(13)` is in CatalogItemEntityTypeConfiguration.cs, and OrdersApi.cs still maps '/card-types'. The turn-1 temporary revert was restored, and turn 2 ran tests against the real code.",
